      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "\"Here We Go\" is a pop song written by Miranda Cooper, Brian Higgins, and Matt Gray, originally recorded by Cooper under the alias Moonbaby. The song was initially released as Moonbaby's first (and only) single in 2000, later being covered by Lene Nystrøm in 2003 and Girls Aloud in 2004. It is the basis for the theme song of the French and Canadian animated television series \"Totally Spies! \", with rewritten lyrics to fit the show about action and spies.",
